From 69683d3ab7103a90314db74e6b4c68e0bddc59df Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 00:14:37 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Client ledger, auto credit, statement email/PDF, aged
 receivables, void

1. Client ledger (client_ledger_entries): every invoice, receipt,
   WHT/VAT/deduction and credit application posted once, never edited.
   Changes post a reversal + corrected entry dated the day of the change,
   so statements already sent never change. Synced after every
   invoice/receipt change, before each statement, and nightly;
   `php artisan client-ledger:sync` fills it from history.
2. Transactions table no longer read: client page tab shows ledger
   lines; Transactions page points to aged receivables.
3. Unused credit applied automatically to new/duplicated invoices
   (per-client switch, default on); manual apply uses the same service.
4. Statement emailed from its page (to/cc/message, PDF attached when
   dompdf is installed, PDF download, send log); client email field.
   Aged receivables report (not due / 1-30 / 31-60 / 61-90 / 90+,
   credit netted, office scope, Excel).
5. Receipts are voided with a reason instead of deleted: archived in
   receipt_voids, bank and ledger reversals, Voided list. Paid invoices
   can't be deleted; invoice total changes re-derive status.

Tests: 66 passing on SQLite and MariaDB 10.11 (PDF test skipped
without dompdf).

